<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h4 id="_4-辅助功能实现" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-辅助功能实现"><span>4. 辅助功能实现</span></a></h4>
<h4 id="_4-1-自动检测锚点" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-1-自动检测锚点"><span>4.1 自动检测锚点</span></a></h4>
<p>通过 <code v-pre>detectAnchors</code> 函数实现自动检测文档中的潜在锚点位置：</p>
<div class="language-javascript line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="js"><pre v-pre><code><span class="line"><span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">const</span> <span class="token function-variable function">detectAnchors</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token parameter">content</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=></span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>
<span class="line">  <span class="token keyword">const</span> anchorPatterns <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span></span>
<span class="line">    <span class="token punctuation">{</span> <span class="token literal-property property">pattern</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token regex"><span class="token regex-delimiter">/</span><span class="token regex-source language-regex">合同编号[：:]</span><span class="token regex-delimiter">/</span><span class="token regex-flags">g</span></span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token literal-property property">type</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'text'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token literal-property property">label</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'合同编号'</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>
<span class="line">    <span class="token punctuation">{</span> <span class="token literal-property property">pattern</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token regex"><span class="token regex-delimiter">/</span><span class="token regex-source language-regex">甲方[：:]</span><span class="token regex-delimiter">/</span><span class="token regex-flags">g</span></span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token literal-property property">type</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'text'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token literal-property property">label</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'甲方'</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>
<span class="line">    <span class="token comment">// ... 其他模式</span></span>
<span class="line">  <span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>
<span class="line">  </span>
<span class="line">  <span class="token keyword">const</span> detectedAnchors <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>
<span class="line">  </span>
<span class="line">  anchorPatterns<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">forEach</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token parameter">patternInfo</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=></span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>
<span class="line">    <span class="token keyword">const</span> matches <span class="token operator">=</span> content<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">match</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>patternInfo<span class="token punctuation">.</span>pattern<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>
<span class="line">    <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>matches<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>
<span class="line">      matches<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">forEach</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=></span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>
<span class="line">        <span class="token keyword">const</span> anchorId <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">generateId</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>
<span class="line">        detectedAnchors<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">push</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>
<span class="line">          <span class="token literal-property property">id</span><span class="token operator">:</span> anchorId<span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>
<span class="line">          <span class="token literal-property property">type</span><span class="token operator">:</span> patternInfo<span class="token punctuation">.</span>type<span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>
<span class="line">          <span class="token literal-property property">label</span><span class="token operator">:</span> patternInfo<span class="token punctuation">.</span>label<span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>
<span class="line">          <span class="token literal-property property">value</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">''</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>
<span class="line">          <span class="token literal-property property">placeholder</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token function">getPlaceholderByType</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>patternInfo<span class="token punctuation">.</span>type<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>
<span class="line">          <span class="token literal-property property">options</span><span class="token operator">:</span> patternInfo<span class="token punctuation">.</span>type <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token string">'select'</span> <span class="token operator">?</span> <span class="token function">getDefaultOptions</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>patternInfo<span class="token punctuation">.</span>label<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token keyword">undefined</span></span>
<span class="line">        <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>
<span class="line">      <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>
<span class="line">    <span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>
<span class="line">  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>
<span class="line">  </span>
<span class="line">  <span class="token keyword">return</span> detectedAnchors<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h4 id="自动插入锚点" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#自动插入锚点"><span>自动插入锚点</span></a></h4>
<p>通过 <code v-pre>insertAnchorsIntoHtml</code> 函数实现自动在HTML内容中插入锚点：</p>
